# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF（跨机器迁移 diff 噪声最小化；项目可迁移铁律）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

# 例外：Windows 批处理必须 CRLF——cmd.exe 对 LF-only 的 .cmd 解析不可靠
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产不参与换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.emmx binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.pq binary
*.model binary
